This directory contains the subroutines the esdf module and the subroutines that use it.

The esdf_mod.f90 was modified in June 2017 to revert to some previous version
and to have the correct behavior with missing data.

Modifications are mostly indicated by !jlm or !JLM

With time this version and PARSEC, CASTEP, CASINO versions have diverged.

Major modifications are:

--  Use of "%block" to indicate a block instead of "begin" to be similar to SIESTA

